# Generated media and receipts belong under /var/lib/amnezia-release-lab or a
# separately supplied external path. Never commit guest disks, ISOs, or answer
# media because they can contain credentials and machine state.
images/*.img
images/*.iso
**/disk.qcow2
**/nocloud.iso
**/windows-answer.iso
**/answer-media/
**/OVMF_VARS*
**/*.receipt.json
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
